# Testing

- Unit tests for domain logic (costing, GST, discounts) in `packages/domain`.
- Integration tests for repositories/services posting purchase/sale/exchange.
- E2E (Playwright) for core flows: purchase → sale → exchange.
- Prefer correctness tests over UI snapshots.
- See `docs/testing.md`.
